</path></svg>Date Converter</a><a class=\"nav-link \" href=\"/tools/qr-generator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-qr-code\"><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"16\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M21 16h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M21 21v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 3h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 16v.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-1\"></path></svg>QR Code Generator</a></nav><div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><span class=\"small-mark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></span><p>A little less effort.<br/><strong>A lot more done.</strong></p><span class=\"version\">Toolbox / v1.0</span></div></aside><div class=\"main-shell\"><header class=\"header\"><div class=\"breadcrumb\"><span>Workspace</span><span class=\"slash\">/</span><span>Calculators</span></div><div class=\"header-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"command-trigger\" aria-label=\"Open command palette\" title=\"Find any tool (Ctrl K)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></button><span class=\"header-note\">Small tools. Everyday useful.</span><button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark theme\" title=\"Switch to dark theme\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"page-transition\"><div class=\"page\"><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>All tools</a><div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calculator\"><rect width=\"16\" height=\"20\" x=\"4\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"18\"></line><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><div><h1>Calculators</h1><p>Small questions. Clear answers.</p></div></div><section class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-5 sm:p-7\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-xl font-semibold text-text\">Basic Calculator</h2><fieldset disabled=\"\" class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"max-w-lg\"><label class=\"text-sm text-text\">Expression<input class=\"mt-2 w-full rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg px-3 py-3 text-text outline-none focus:border-accent\" placeholder=\"(120 + 80) × 10%\" maxLength=\"2000\" value=\"\"/></label><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"Clear expression\">AC</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"(\">(</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\")\">)</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"Backspace\">⌫</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"7\">7</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"8\">8</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"9\">9</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"÷\">÷</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"4\">4</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"5\">5</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"6\">6</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"×\">×</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"1\">1</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"2\">2</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"3\">3</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"−\">−</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"0\">0</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\".\">.</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"%\">%</button><button class=\"rounded-panel border border-border bg-bg py-3 text-lg text-text\" aria-label=\"+\">+</button></div><button class=\"primary-button mt-3 w-full\">= Calculate</button><dl aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"></dl></div></fieldset><p class=\"mt-6 border-t border-border pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-dim\">Supports +, −, ×, ÷, parentheses, and %. A percentage is divided by 100: 200 × 10% = 20.</p></section><div class=\"mt-10\"><label class=\"mb-2 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-dim sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg>Search calculators</span><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Try EMI, GPA, age…\" class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel px-3 py-3 text-text outline-none focus:border-accent\" value=\"\"/></label><p class=\"mb-4 text-xs text-dim\">14<!-- --> calculators · ordered from simple to more involved</p><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/basic\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">01<!-- --> · <!-- -->Everyday</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Basic Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Everyday arithmetic with a keypad and keyboard.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/discount\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">02<!-- --> · <!-- -->Everyday</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Discount Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Sale price and how much you save.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/tip\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">03<!-- --> · <!-- -->Everyday</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Tip / Bill Splitter</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Add a tip and split the total evenly.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/tax\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">04<!-- --> · <!-- -->Money</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">GST / VAT Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Fill any two: tax rate, before-tax price, or after-tax price.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/profit-margin\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">05<!-- --> · <!-- -->Money</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Profit Margin Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Compare profit, margin, and markup.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/simple-interest\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">06<!-- --> · <!-- -->Money</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Simple Interest Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Interest earned on the original amount.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/bmi\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">07<!-- --> · <!-- -->Health</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">BMI Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Adult body mass index using metric or imperial units.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel p-4 hover:border-accent\" href=\"/tools/calculators/aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs text-dim\">08<!-- --> · <!-- -->Design</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right text-accent\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-text\">Aspect Ratio Calculator</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-dim\">Reduce dimensions and resize proportionally.</p></a><a class=\"interaction-card rou